  "fullDescription": "Bellovia is a modern serif font with a touch of feminine elegance, combining luxury, style, and timeless charm. Designed to bring a chic and sophisticated look, this typeface is perfect for branding, logos, editorials, magazines, wedding invitations, packaging, and any creative project that needs an elegant and classy serif.\n\nWith its refined curves, distinctive characters, and artistic details, Bellovia strikes the perfect balance between modern design and a romantic, feminine vibe, making your work look more exclusive and professional.\n\nIf you are looking for a serif typeface that is modern, elegant, and feminine, Bellovia is the perfect choice to elevate your design projects.\n\nBellovia font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
